Error [E0042]: a shebang line is only recognized at the very start of the file
  --> tests/ui/shebang_not_at_file_start.jet:4:2
    |
  4 |  #!/usr/bin/env jet
    |  ^^
 Why: the operating system reads launch metadata only from byte 0; Jet does not treat another `#!` as a launch line
 Fix: move `#!...` to line 1, or delete it
